issue.message:
Unexpected failure during lint analysis of HomeActivity.java (this is a bug in lint or one of the libraries it depends on)

Message: Incorrect type 'androidx/leanback/app/BaseSupportFragment' (JDK_20)

The crash seems to involve the detector `com.android.tools.lint.checks.PrivateApiDetector`.
You can try disabling it with something like this:
    android {
        lint {
            disable "BlockedPrivateApi", "DiscouragedPrivateApi", "PrivateApi", "SoonBlockedPrivateApi"
        }
    }

